<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n57784" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλειτός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ʽκλείω</span> B)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>renowned, famous</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίκουροι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					3.451
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				6.227
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βασιλῆες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					6.54
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γενεά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>N.</u>
					6.61
				</span></i>
			; of things, <i>splendid, excellent</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑκατόμβη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					4.102
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				10.33
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πανοπεύς, Ἰωλκός</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				17.307
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				4.77
			</span></i>.</div>
